[{"title":"汴路水驿","author":"陈䞇","text":"泊舟依水驿，堤树晚含风。\n鱼跃翠萍里，鹭拳青草中。\n人家如颍上，风景似江东。\n杯酒自斟酌，故人那得同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34233,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日留别","author":"陈䞇","text":"江上草离离，江头折柳枝。\n那堪别君日，又是落花时。\n飞蝶随行李，啼鹃恼梦思。\n他时肯相过，应不负幽期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34234,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿江店","author":"陈䞇","text":"今宵宿江店，门外有芦花。\n到县无十里，为邻只数家。\n灯明茅屋小，月转竹篱斜。\n忽听歌声起，渔舟傍浅沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34235,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中赠日南僧","author":"陈䞇","text":"此处结庵久，故山天一涯。\n绕檐閒数竹，汲涧自浇花。\n晨击香台磬，宵分石鼎茶。\n双峰已堪老，无梦更思家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34236,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和圣制从蓬莱向兴庆阁道中留春望之作","author":"陈䞇","text":"跸道尘清入望赊，秦川下绕汉宫斜。\n霓旌晓拂江堤柳，雉扇晴迷苑树花。\n处处笙歌随御辇，重重台观即仙家。\n职居献纳惭无补，也得从容扈翠华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34237,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送少府贬柳州","author":"陈䞇","text":"怜君谪宦向边庭，对酒愁闻歌吹声。\n落日茫茫乡思远，沧江渺渺客帆轻。\n楚猿啸月过衡岭，越鸟啼烟傍柳城。\n贾傅投椷吊湘水，至今流恨未能平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34238,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同温丹徒登高万岁楼","author":"陈䞇","text":"望中云树远依依，傍水人家烟火微。\n斜日海门潮欲上，西风江郭雁初飞。\n乡园迢递音书隔，旅泊萧条故旧稀。\n惟有金焦山色好，高依楼阁翠成围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34239,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄司勋卢员外","author":"陈䞇","text":"书剑年来寄洛阳，几回吟赋不成章。\n花前谁共金樽酒，月下空怀画省郎。\n欹枕客窗频有梦，鸣珂禁署忆含香。\n黄鹂最是多情鸟，时哢春声在绿杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34240,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与仲弟兵曹宴集","author":"陈䞇","text":"索居谁与话襟期，舍弟能来慰我思。\n窗外花枝堪对酒，梦中池草易成诗。\n正当绿树莺啼处，待得清溪月上时。\n且尽金樽同一醉，云台勋业未为迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34241,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陆澧仓曹西上","author":"陈䞇","text":"临歧把袂思依依，行役何时暂息机。\n关树微茫人去远，乡心迢递雁来稀。\n呜珂早见趋枫陛，载酒谁还款竹扉。\n都下若逢相识问，沧洲将老芰荷衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34242,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别严士元","author":"陈䞇","text":"送君迢递出江城，啼鸟关关绿树晴。\n雨过沧洲春草色，日斜烟寺暮钟声。\n湖南归客应多梦，天际孤帆不尽情。\n别后相思空对月，一杯何处叙平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34243,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得","author":"陈䞇","text":"车骑西征是几年，玉关迢递路三千。\n乌啼窗外日当午，角怨楼头霜满天。\n锦织回文空寄恨，烛流残泪未成眠。\n不堪倚遍阑干曲，目断黄云益渺然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34244,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马秀才落第归江南","author":"陈䞇","text":"临歧劝酒莫辞频，相送东郊草色新。\n马上鸡声函谷曙，天边帆影洞庭春。\n明年再结看花伴，今日谁怜失意人。\n别后相思何处是，南楼望月欲沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34245,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪口送人归岳州","author":"陈䞇","text":"青溪溪树叶初飞，野渡萧条过客稀。\n落日天边孤鸟没，秋风江上片帆归。\n吟诗已见添新稿，把钓还须访旧矶。\n我亦欲寻鸥鹭伴，短篷烟雨绿蓑衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚次鄂州","author":"陈䞇","text":"客帆收处近江城，偶遇乡人问去程。\n梦渚白蘋寒雁下，汉阳红树暮烟生。\n故乡又是经年别，夜月空怜几度明。\n吟倚篷窗思无限，几家砧杵散秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送长沙李少府入蜀","author":"陈䞇","text":"路入瞿塘征棹迟，此行应未卜归期。\n九秋雁影云边去，三峡猿声月下悲。\n桑落酒香江店日，芙蓉花谢锦城时。\n夕阳楼上频回首，湘水巴山有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人游江南","author":"陈䞇","text":"客程南去景偏新，惆怅离歌起暮津。\n绿树红桥沽酒市，清江白石浣纱人。\n钟催晓月过吴甸，帆趁寒潮到富春。\n棋客诗僧相见好，莫因吟赏滞归秦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登柳州城楼寄漳汀封连四州","author":"陈䞇","text":"一上层楼望八荒，鸟牵愁思入苍茫。\n西风逻骑巡蛮徼，落日啼鸦在女墙。\n瘴雨来时凄客况，夷歌起处断人肠。\n遥怜彼此俱迁谪，试问何年归故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南原望汉宫","author":"陈䞇","text":"汉宫犹有昔时名，落日荒郊望去平。\n白鸟遥从烟际没，绿芜多向雨中生。\n川原不尽登临意，今古徒兴感慨情。\n金殿玉楼俱寂莫，青山依旧片云横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜投丰德寺谒海上人","author":"陈䞇","text":"香台閒夜诵经声，偶遇山僧问姓名。\n灯剪松窗留客话，月明萝径少人行。\n茗瓯饮罢心尘净，石榻眠来梦寐清。\n他日远公容入社，还从此处学无生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿淮浦寄司空曙","author":"陈䞇","text":"客边还仗酒消忧，千里关河叹远游。\n秋尽楚乡逢落木，雨来淮浦驻扁舟。\n流光冉冉人将老，往事滔滔水共流。\n欹枕夜深偏不寐，谁家吹笛岸西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送韩侍御归山","author":"陈䞇","text":"乞身才出五云间，笑脱朝簪一骑还。\n在昔清风满台阁，如今归兴绕溪山。\n家园霜果行当熟，岩寺烟萝几度攀。\n啼鸟隔窗催睡起，柴门无事不须关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汀州元使君","author":"陈䞇","text":"暂离天仗君休惜，共贺专城是显官。\n身佩竹符辞晓阙，吏迎兰棹过秋滩。\n行春或驻花边马，赏月还凭竹外栏。\n见说好山当郡舍，雨晴长是捲帘看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄和州刘使君","author":"陈䞇","text":"郡人无讼官多暇，春酒何妨泻玉瓶。\n车骑閒过杨柳陌，笙歌宜醉藕花亭。\n江边烟草铺堤绿，楼外云山隔岸青。\n我有新诗遥寄与，凭谁吟向使君听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦瑟","author":"陈䞇","text":"参差雁柱架朱弦，绮席听弹忆往年。\n汉苑风恬飞乳燕，巴山月落诉啼鹃。\n芙蓉碧沼凉含露，杨柳芳堤暖飏烟。\n却笑江州老司马，琵琶一曲已潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行经华阴","author":"陈䞇","text":"西华山高近玉京，芙蓉千叠画难成。\n白云深处仙坛古，翠蔼浮时岳雨晴。\n渭水波声流去远，秦川草色望来平。\n栖岩多有烧丹侣，应笑红尘役此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵怀古","author":"陈䞇","text":"结绮临春事已终，后庭玉树旧歌空。\n青山云锁梁朝寺，绿草烟荒晋代宫。\n淮渚芙蓉零露晓，冶城杨柳散春风。\n如今却值升平世，金碧楼台霄汉中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伊州歌","author":"陈䞇","text":"何事辽西将，经年未息兵。\n遥怜荷殳者，月黑夜移营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中送别","author":"陈䞇","text":"别去空惆怅，萧然掩竹扉。\n山中紫芝老，君定几时归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸟鸣涧","author":"陈䞇","text":"暝树含苍霭，春云散碧空。\n如何幽涧鸟，啼向月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木兰砦","author":"陈䞇","text":"青山明夕阳，白鹭立秋水。\n忽闻渔笛吹，令人思无已。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹里馆","author":"陈䞇","text":"幽馆万竹中，秋声助吟啸。\n来此欲忘归，深林漏斜照。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池萍","author":"陈䞇","text":"晓池双白鸟，飞去复飞回。\n一片浮萍合，轻桡拨不开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中寄诸弟","author":"陈䞇","text":"城间多乐事，独此叹离群。\n倚杖看飞雁，行行入楚云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班媫妤二首 其一","author":"陈䞇","text":"长信秋风早，宫槐叶半疏。\n凄凉泣团扇，空复候銮舆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班媫妤二首 其二","author":"陈䞇","text":"玉阶华露滋，金辇来踪绝。\n凉吹拂罗帏，飞萤自明灭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江曲","author":"陈䞇","text":"玉树绿沈沈，流莺啼满林。\n春波摇不定，真可比郎心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛阳道作献吕四郎二首 其一","author":"陈䞇","text":"洛城春雨馀，夹道垂杨绿。\n歌管绮楼人，朝朝欢未足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛阳道作献吕四郎二首 其二","author":"陈䞇","text":"挟弹冶游子，金丸手中把。\n忽听啼鸟声，勒住青骢马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛阳道","author":"陈䞇","text":"春日洛阳陌，纷纷来往人。\n落花如有意，飞逐马蹄尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长干行","author":"陈䞇","text":"住近白门下，浣纱淮水侧。\n背立向东风，低头怕人识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南行 其一","author":"陈䞇","text":"明妆荡兰桨，两两度横塘。\n忽听歌声起，悠悠云水乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南行 其二","author":"陈䞇","text":"江渚秋风起，荷花渐觉稀。\n小舟閒并看，日暮未言归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"陈䞇","text":"玉阶凄风起，桂花落如雪。\n罗帏银烛微，啼螀怨明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流水曲","author":"陈䞇","text":"日晚潮初落，白蘋花满洲。\n中流船渡急，欲住苦无由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长信草","author":"陈䞇","text":"宫草宁无意，先从静处生。\n青青长自好，玉辇不来行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲","author":"陈䞇","text":"深入荷花里，红妆映碧流。\n香风传笑语，不见木兰舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"陈䞇","text":"多情堤畔柳，袅袅学纤腰。\n日晚菱歌起，归舟趁落潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还剡中旧居","author":"陈䞇","text":"短棹沿溪入，烟村带夕阳。\n山中春雨过，几许药苗长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸公有怀","author":"陈䞇","text":"为忆同袍友，如今不在门。\n只因为客久，识得异乡言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草宫怀古","author":"陈䞇","text":"故宫芳草色，寂莫几经春。\n草上双胡蝶，飞飞来近人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张十八归桐庐","author":"陈䞇","text":"临流相送处，暝色起烟村。\n野艇随潮去，更深想到门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方外上人","author":"陈䞇","text":"锡影凌秋云，深入千峰住。\n他日欲相寻，清钟响何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听弹琴","author":"陈䞇","text":"孤琴奏明月，松泉夜生寒。\n岂无古时调，不堪今日弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对残灯","author":"陈䞇","text":"寒灯伴吟久，夜深微欲灭。\n孤客未成眠，尚惜红蕤结。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同褒子秋霁独宿","author":"陈䞇","text":"秋声在何许，潇潇一庭竹。\n明月入疏棂，来照幽人宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬李益","author":"陈䞇","text":"忆昔去江东，思君梦寐同。\n红颜容易老，相见各成翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别司空曙","author":"陈䞇","text":"话别秋堤畔，寒蝉声更悲。\n夕阳孤棹去，正是落潮时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行无题","author":"陈䞇","text":"云帆秋水阔，烟树晚村深。\n閒倚孤篷久，遥闻风外砧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿洞口馆","author":"陈䞇","text":"冷猿溪上啸，寒溜槛边鸣。\n此处往来少，满庭秋草生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"陈䞇","text":"飞甍侵碧汉，人语半空间。\n云际横眉黛，不知何处山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别顾明府","author":"陈䞇","text":"沧江春雨馀，离离汀树湿。\n樽酒不成欢，东风去帆急。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三闾庙","author":"陈䞇","text":"湘水流无尽，江蓠烟雨深。\n古祠人罕到，鶗鴂怨春林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜春","author":"陈䞇","text":"落花飞阵阵，无计可留春。\n酒到休辞满，啼莺亦劝人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"零陵早春","author":"陈䞇","text":"草色回晴渚，禽声动晓原。\n春风自此去，几日到家园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙驿前南楼感旧","author":"陈䞇","text":"此日成长别，茫茫度几秋。\n湘潭今夜月，惆怅独登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野田","author":"陈䞇","text":"田荒尽秋草，牛羊践成道。\n牧儿吹笛归，萧萧野棠老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿云亭","author":"陈䞇","text":"地偏人迹少，亭子面山开。\n最是秋檐外，閒云去复来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜花","author":"陈䞇","text":"无奈花零落，枝头顿觉稀。\n残红真可惜，拾取袖中归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岸花","author":"陈䞇","text":"溪上花如锦，繁枝映柳条。\n游人最相惜，来此久停桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄西峰僧","author":"陈䞇","text":"山溜细涓涓，松庭夜鹤眠。\n西峰残月堕，趺坐佛灯前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别","author":"陈䞇","text":"东风江上柳丝丝，此际分襟更觉悲。\n后夜他乡对明月，相思却念别离时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明妃词 其一","author":"陈䞇","text":"雪片纷纷帐外飞，晓寒微透缕金衣。\n汉宫迢递知何处，只有清宵一梦归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明妃词 其二","author":"陈䞇","text":"晓临妆镜默含悲，还把琵琶写怨词。\n玉貌可怜憔悴尽，如今不似汉宫时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凉州词","author":"陈䞇","text":"哀笳遥起戍楼间，少见平原多见山。\n惆怅葫芦河上客，立残斜日望乡关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西宫春怨","author":"陈䞇","text":"锦屏愁倚懒焚香，寂莫西宫春昼长。\n凤辇不来庭草绿，隔溪啼鸟送斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青楼怨","author":"陈䞇","text":"春深杨柳花拂楼，閒理琵琶自写愁。\n惆怅玉关人去远，珠帘不忍上银钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]